  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "# FairLens — Modeling Notebook\n\nTrains 10 credit-decisioning models on HMDA 2021 NY mortgage data (~95K test records) and evaluates them on statistical fairness metrics and per-applicant dollar-cost gaps.\n\n**The Fairness Paradox:** The model with the highest Disparate Impact (LR Baseline, DI=0.979) has ~2× the per-applicant racial cost gap of NN + Focal Loss (DI=0.970). Picking by DI alone leaves ~$2,378/applicant of disparate harm undetected.\n\n**Run order:** Top to bottom. Runtime: ~25–35 min for training + bootstrap CI computation.\n\n**Outputs saved to `artifacts/`:** `test_probs.parquet`, `test_meta.parquet`, `cost_meta.parquet`, `bootstrap_cis.json`, `race_detail.parquet`"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "d7cd0de2",
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "outputId": "d62a4934-7ab2-40d3-e2bc-97bca1898286"
   },
   "source": [
    "suspect_features = [\n",
    "    'interest_rate_log',\n",
    "    'property_value_log',\n",
    "    'loan_to_value_ratio',\n",
    "    'income_log',\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "for feat in suspect_features:\n",
    "    if feat in X_train_pr.columns:\n",
    "        X_tr = X_train_pr.drop(columns=[feat])\n",
    "        X_te = X_test_pr.drop(columns=[feat])\n",
    "        sc = StandardScaler()\n",
    "        X_tr_s = sc.fit_transform(X_tr); X_te_s = sc.transform(X_te)\n",
    "        dt_test = DecisionTreeClassifier(\n",
    "            max_depth=10, min_samples_leaf=50,\n",
    "            class_weight='balanced', random_state=42)\n",
    "        dt_test.fit(X_tr_s, y_train)\n",
    "        auc = roc_auc_score(y_test, dt_test.predict_proba(X_te_s)[:,1])\n",
    "        print(f\"DT without {feat:<25}  AUC: {auc:.4f}  \"\n",
    "              f\"(drop from 0.9875: {0.9875-auc:+.4f})\")"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": [
      "DT without interest_rate_log          AUC: 0.8102  (drop from 0.9875: +0.1773)\n",
      "DT without property_value_log         AUC: 0.9876  (drop from 0.9875: -0.0001)\n",
      "DT without loan_to_value_ratio        AUC: 0.9875  (drop from 0.9875: -0.0000)\n",
      "DT without income_log                 AUC: 0.9875  (drop from 0.9875: +0.0000)\n"
     ]
    }
   ]
