   "source": "## 11. Dollar-Cost Gap: The Fairness Paradox\n**Key finding:** The model with the *highest* DI (LR Baseline, DI=0.979) has ~2× the per-applicant racial cost gap of the best model (NN + Focal Loss, DI=0.970).\n\nPicking by DI alone leaves ~$2,378/applicant of disparate financial harm undetected — approximately $227M over the 95,588-applicant test set."
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": "# CELL 11 â Dollar-Cost Gap Summary\n# ââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââ\ngap_tracker = {}\nfor name, preds, _, _, _ in all_models:\n    _, gap = compute_dollar_cost(\n        y_test_np, preds, race_test_np,\n        loan_amounts, interest_rates, loan_terms,\n        lgd=0.40, discount_rate=0.03,\n        model_name=name\n    )\n    gap_tracker[name] = gap\n\nbaseline_gap = gap_tracker['LR Baseline']\n\nnon_overshoot = {n: g for n, g in gap_tracker.items()\n                 if (g * baseline_gap) >= 0}\n\nbest_model = (min(non_overshoot, key=lambda k: abs(non_overshoot[k]))\n              if non_overshoot\n              else min(gap_tracker, key=lambda k: abs(gap_tracker[k])))\n\nprint(f'\\n{\"=\"*75}')\nprint('SUMMARY â Racial Gap in Per-Applicant Cost (LGD=40%, Rate=3%)')\nprint(f\"{'='*75}\")\nprint(f\"{'Model':<25} {'Gap ($)':>12} {'Reduction':>12} {'Abs Gap':>12}\")\nprint(f\"{'â'*75}\")\n\nfor name, gap in gap_tracker.items():\n    abs_reduction = (1 - abs(gap) / abs(baseline_gap)) * 100\n    overshoot = (gap * baseline_gap) < 0  # signs differ â flipped\n    marker    = ' â' if name == best_model and not overshoot else ''\n    direction = ' â overcorrected' if overshoot else ''\n    print(f\"{name:<25} ${gap:>11,.2f} {abs_reduction:>10.1f}% \"\n          f\"{abs(gap):>11,.2f}{marker}{direction}\")\n\nprint(f\"{'='*75}\")\nprint(\"\\nFairness Paradox: highest DI model â  lowest dollar gap\")\n\n\n\n# ââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââââ"
