   "source": "## 13. Subgroup Analysis (4 Groups)\nBreaks down White/NonWhite binary into Black / Hispanic / Asian / White. Reveals **loan-size amplification**: the dollar gap is disproportionately larger for Black applicants because HMDA approvals for this group skew to smaller loan sizes."
  },
